  "notes": "final-round wave-3 2026-10-14: pid 2411140513211626400 (CJJT2194663), listedNum 3. Listing: 'Nordic Black And White Abstract Decorative Painting Wabi-sabi Style Hanging Painting'; 12 prints A-L (A Parallel, B Thorns, C Nightfall, D Support, E Twine, F Ping Hit, G Withstand, H Flow elimination, I Rely on, J Touch, K Connect, L Isolation), all black ink gestures on cream, same frame and mat. Verbatim: 'Outer frame material: Aluminum alloy'; 'Conventional: aluminum alloy + canvas'; 'Containing glass: aluminum alloy + precision-cut cardboard + high-transparency organic glass'; sizes 40x40 and 50x50. Photos: thin matte-black frame, very wide warm-white mat (image window about 45% of the width), so charcoal covers roughly 10-15% of the face. COPY RISK (designer/QA must check before listing): the brushwork reads like Franz Kline's black ink studies (1950s, still in copyright); no artist is named and the titles are generic, but if these are reproductions of known works they are banned (studio rule: no known works). Plexiglass is 'high-transparency', not anti-reflective. ROOM SKU: vid 2411140513211626600 ('Style A-Conventional-40x40cm', CJJT219466301AZ, $12.93 each, 2.05 kg packed, carton 45x45x5); sold as a SET OF 3 different prints of the series (the customer picks 3 of the 12; 4 distinct trios possible). price.cost = 3 x $12.93. Unglazed canvas chosen for the corridor (spec: no glossy glass). A glazed 40x40 with a real cardboard mat exists at $11.28 (vid 2411140513211627000, freight not quoted). FREIGHT to IL per piece (conventional 40x40): CJPacket Eub 12-50 d $29.57; Sensitive 22-27 d $44.41; To Door 11-18 d $49.04; DHL 3-7 d $201.82. ECONOMICS (Studio formula, set of 3, Eub): ship $81.27, landed ILS 396.20; at ILS 749 contribution ILS 171.59, margin 27.0% (below 40%, no loss; breakeven ILS 523). Fast option (To Door) loses at ILS 749 (-3.3%). At the old slot price ILS 364 the set loses (-39.2%). PRICE BASIS (Israeli comps): Print Studio set-of-3 category (Nordic/japandi sets) ILS 979 (https://printstudio.co.il/product-category/%d7%a1%d7%98-%d7%a9%d7%9c%d7%99%d7%a9%d7%99%d7%99%d7%aa-%d7%aa%d7%9e%d7%95%d7%a0%d7%95%d7%aa/); Tollmans 50x50 print + frame ILS 389 each (https://www.tollmansdot.co.il/product/ovata_linework_light_02_50x50/); 1item wood-frame 40x50 series ILS 99 each / ILS 297 for three, plain frame without mat (https://www.1item.co.il/products/%D7%AA%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%A0%D7%94-%D7%9E%D7%A1%D7%92%D7%A8%D7%AA-%D7%A2%D7%A5-%D7%A4%D7%9C%D7%95%D7%90%D7%95-40-50-%D7%A1%D7%9E). Typical designer set ~ILS 979 -> ILS 749 (-23%). ENVELOPE (corridor gallery: 3 prints, each 40 wide x 45-50 high, gap 20, frame depth 2-3): 40 wide fits; 40 high is 5 cm under 45 -> BORDERLINE, check in frame (no 40x50 size in the listing; 50x50 is 10 cm too wide). Spec match: one series, charcoal on warm white with charcoal at about 10-15% of the face (wide mat), matte-black frame, no glossy glazing. STYLE FIT GUESS (sourcing, not a designer score): nordic 7 (borderline height), japandi 7 (ink abstract, thin black frame; mat is warm white, not washi), warm-modern 6, mediterranean 3, modern-country 3, boho 3."
